  "title": "Qt: I/O Graph click and zoom only with LeftButton",
  "description": "Clicks other than LeftButton shouldn't go to the selected packet\n(that's our behavior in, e.g., the FlowGraph.)\n\nQCustomPlot controls dragging, and only performs it with the LeftButton.\nPressing and releasing other buttons shouldn't affect whether we're\ndragging. We control zooming, so possibly we could allow it with some\nother buttons that aren't RightButton.",
